                                Degree UG Programme with Illinois Institute of Technology?
                            </p>

                            <img src="https://images.mastersunion.link/uploads/25062025/v1/MainButton3.svg"
                                class="toggler" alt="Icon">
                        </div>
                        <p class="faqanswer" id="tab-i-3">Students are strongly encouraged to decide on opting for the
                            3+1 Dual Degree UG Programme before starting their undergraduate journey at Masters’ Union.
                            Early confirmation ensures guaranteed seat allocation and allows for streamlined academic
                            planning tailored to the programme's requirements.
                            <br> <br>While students may still choose to opt for the programme during their third year,
                            this is subject to seat availability, which will be communicated at that time. Confirming at
                            the beginning ensures a smooth transition and optimal preparation for their transfer to
                            Illinois Tech.

                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="faqquestionWrap mb30" data-rel="tab-i-4">
                        <div class="left">
                            <p class="faqHeading">Will the curriculum at Illinois Tech align with what students study at
                                Masters’ Union?
                            </p>

                            <img src="https://images.mastersunion.link/uploads/25062025/v1/MainButton3.svg"
                                class="toggler" alt="Icon">
                        </div>
                        <p class="faqanswer" id="tab-i-4">Yes, the curriculum has been designed to ensure a seamless
                            transfer between the institutions. Students will continue to build on the foundational and
                            advanced topics they study at Masters’ Union.</p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="faqquestionWrap mb30" data-rel="tab-i-5">
                        <div class="left">
                            <p class="faqHeading">Can students secure internships in the US while at Illinois Tech?

                            </p>

                            <img src="https://images.mastersunion.link/uploads/25062025/v1/MainButton3.svg"
                                class="toggler" alt="Icon">
                        </div>
                        <p class="faqanswer" id="tab-i-5">Yes, students will have access to Illinois Tech’s career
                            services, which include internship placements, job fairs, and networking events with global
                            employers.</p>
                    </div>



                </div>

                <div id="tab10" class="content">

                    <div class="faqquestionWrap mb30" data-rel="tab-j-1">
                        <div class="left">
                            <p class="faqHeading">What is the structure of the IIT programme?</p>

                            <img src="https://images.mastersunion.link/uploads/25062025/v1/MainButton3.svg"
                                class="toggler" alt="Icon">
                        </div>
                        <p class="faqanswer" id="tab-j-1">The IIT programme of Masters' Union's UG Programme in Data
                            Science and Artificial Intelligence gives the student an option to enrol in IIT Guwahati's
                            online undergraduate of Science (Honours) in Data Science & Artificial Intelligence <a
                                href="https://www.coursera.org/degrees/undergraduate-of-science-data-science-ai-iitguwahati"
                                class="yellowGradient" target="_blank">Check Programme</a>.


                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="faqquestionWrap mb30" data-rel="tab-j-2">
                        <div class="left">
                            <p class="faqHeading">What are the benefits of this programme?
                            </p>

                            <img src="https://images.mastersunion.link/uploads/25062025/v1/MainButton3.svg"
                                class="toggler" alt="Icon">
                        </div>
                        <p class="faqanswer" id="tab-j-2">In this programme you gain a comprehensive education in data
                            science and artificial intelligence from two esteemed institutions, Masters’ Union and IIT
                            Guwahati. Along with Masters’ Union, students get access to IIT’s industry-oriented
                            curriculum, covering advanced topics and providing hands-on experience with high-performance
                            computing facilities.</p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="faqquestionWrap mb30" data-rel="tab-j-3">
                        <div class="left">
                            <p class="faqHeading"> What is the fee structure and who pays for it? </p>

                            <img src="https://images.mastersunion.link/uploads/25062025/v1/MainButton3.svg"
                                class="toggler" alt="Icon">
                        </div>
                        <p class="faqanswer" id="tab-j-3">The fee structure for the programme is available on our <a
                                href="/ug-data-science-admissions-and-fees" class="yellowGradient">website</a>. Students
                            pay a single fee to Masters' Union for the entire 4-year Undergraduate Programme in Data
                            Science & AI, which includes the IIT programme fees. Masters' Union also handles all
                            registration and administrative processes for the chosen IIT, ensuring a hassle-free
                            experience for students.

                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="faqquestionWrap mb30" data-rel="tab-j-4">
                        <div class="left">
                            <p class="faqHeading"> Why should I not enrol directly in IIT Guwahati without Masters'
                                Union? </p>

                            <img src="https://images.mastersunion.link/uploads/25062025/v1/MainButton3.svg"
                                class="toggler" alt="Icon">
                        </div>
                        <div class="faqanswer detailsList faq-log" id="tab-j-4">Enrolling through the collaboration with
                            Masters' Union offers several unique benefits:

                            <ul class="list">
                                <li>
                                    <p><span class="black-medium">Industry Immersion: </span>Spend 3 Years at Masters'
                                        Union, followed by a one-year industry immersion at top tech giants in India,
                                        providing you with invaluable hands-on experience.

                                    </p>
                                </li>
                                <li>
                                    <p><span class="black-medium">Dual Advantage & Professional Certificate: </span> You
                                        get parallel enrollment in the undergraduate of Science at IIT Guwahati, and also
                                        receive a Professional Certificate for the Undergraduate Programme in Data
                                        Science & AI from Masters' Union, enhancing your credentials.

                                    </p>
                                </li>
                                <li>
                                    <p><span class="black-medium">Placement Opportunities: </span>Masters' Union’s
                                        strong ties with marquee recruiters like Microsoft, Google, PwC, and Krutrim
                                        increase your chances of securing top placements.</p>
                                </li>


                            </ul>

                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="faqquestionWrap mb30" data-rel="tab-j-5">
                        <div class="left">
                            <p class="faqHeading">Can I get both the Illinois Tech degree and the IIT degree?</p>

                            <img src="https://images.mastersunion.link/uploads/25062025/v1/MainButton3.svg"
                                class="toggler" alt="Icon">
                        </div>
                        <p class="faqanswer" id="tab-j-5">Yes, with the option to enrol in undergraduate of Science at IIT
                            Guwahati, you can pursue the degree for 3 years and spend your 4th year at Illinois Tech,
                            Chicago, earning a second degree — a undergraduate of Science in AI. This pathway allows you to
                            graduate with two prestigious degrees in 4 years, along with global exposure and placement
                            opportunities in the US.<br><br>
                            Alternatively, if you choose to complete all 4 years in India, you spend your final year
                            immersed in a hands-on industry internship, gaining practical experience with top tech
                            companies.

                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>


